      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc patch mce multiclusterengine --type=merge -p \\\n  '{\"spec\":{\"overrides\":{\"components\":[{\"name\":\"hypershift\",\"enabled\": false}]}}}'"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>The default <code>MultiClusterEngine</code> resource instance name is <code>multiclusterengine</code>, but you can get the <code>MultiClusterEngine</code> name from your cluster by running the following command: <code>$ oc get mce</code>.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      You can verify that the <code>hypershift</code> and <code>hypershift-local-hosting</code> features are disabled in the <code>MultiClusterEngine</code> custom resource by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get mce multiclusterengine -o yaml"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>The default <code>MultiClusterEngine</code> resource instance name is <code>multiclusterengine</code>, but you can get the <code>MultiClusterEngine</code> name from your cluster by running the following command: <code>$ oc get mce</code>.</p>
      <p>See the following example where <code>hypershift</code> and <code>hypershift-local-hosting</code> have their <code>enabled:</code> flags set to <code>false</code>:</p>
